      "evidence_id": "pdfplumber:abstract",
      "source": "pdf_layout",
      "field": "abstract",
      "raw_text": "We use pairings over elliptic curves to give a collusion- resistant traitor tracing scheme where the sizes of public keys, secret keys, and ciphertexts are independent of the number of users. Prior con- structions from pairings had sizeΩ(N 1/3). An additional consequence of our techniques is general result showing that attribute-based encryption for circuits generically implies optimal traitor tracing.",
